# 🚀 Product Discovery & Sprint Planning — Capstone Day 1

> **ABTalks 60-Day Claude AI Challenge — Day 51**

## 📌 Overview

Day 1 marks the beginning of my **10-Day Capstone Project**. Instead of jumping straight into coding, I focused on the most important part of software development—**discovering the right problem to solve** and creating a clear roadmap for building a polished MVP.

The goal is to follow a complete software development lifecycle:

* Product Discovery
* Requirements Gathering
* Sprint Planning
* System Design
* Development
* Testing
* Deployment
* Maintenance

This foundation will guide the next nine days of development.

